  "description": "What if your partner wanted to break up… Unless you were willing to degrade him? Nanho just wants a normal relationship. As long as his lover has a handsome face, he’s happy. His boyfriend, Myungjoon, is beautiful but can’t get off unless he’s being criticized. Myungjoon’s hot brother, Su-an, also likes Nanho but he needs a partner that’s into hardcore S&M. These three difficult people must navigate the struggle of meeting their own romantic requirements or end up frustrated and alone. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
